# File: graf-new.prf
#
# This file defines special attr/char mappings for use in "graphics" mode
# with the MicroChasm Tileset.
#
# Note: Most graphics are now defined in the data files:
#   - lib/edit/monster.txt (T: lines for monster tiles)
#   - lib/edit/terrain.txt (T: lines for terrain tiles)
#   - lib/edit/object.txt (T: lines for object tiles)
#   - lib/edit/flavor.txt (T: lines for flavor tiles)
#   - lib/edit/effect.txt (T: lines for special effect tiles)
#
# This file is kept for potential user customization overrides.
#
# See "lib/help/command.txt" and "src/files.c" for more information.
#
